__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Source research material: NEVER committed.
#
# The Manifold archive, the Sigma-infinity thesis, the NN Disk and m1-bordon
# snapshots, the HTML visualisations and the external papers are the author's
# private research corpus.  This repository holds only what it *derives* from
# them -- condensations, measurements, claims and corrections -- never the
# originals.
#
# docs/MANIFOLD_REFERENCE.md is a condensation and belongs here.
# artifacts/manifold/SOURCE_INDEX.md holds character offsets and term counts
# only, no source text.  Both are deliberate; everything below is not.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.docx
*.doc
*.dotx
*.pdf
*.pptx
*.potx
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.rar
*.7z
*.html
*.htm

# extracted or ingested copies of the above, under any name
**/ingest/
**/uploads/
*manifold_latest*
*Manifold_Research_Atlas*
*Polycosmic*
*Sigma_Infinity*
*nnnhyperbolicramdisk*
*m1-bordon*
*heralded*
*telos_over_substrate*
*fauna_over_substrate*
*continuumcalculator*
*.ingested.txt
*_source.txt

# generated binaries and figures (repo policy: no binary artifacts)
artifacts/**/plots/*
!artifacts/**/plots/.gitkeep
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.svg
*.gif

# --- privacy barrier -------------------------------------------------------
# Added after a file listing surfaced personal material next to project source:
# a dismissal claim, an NDA, ID documents, and a recovery-codes file. None of it
# was ever tracked here (verified against the full history, not just the tree),
# and this block exists so an accidental `git add -A` in a directory that also
# holds those categories cannot stage them. It blocks FORMATS, not names --
# names change and formats do not.
*.apk
*.exe
*.pkg
*.rpm
*.7z
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.torrent
*.docx
*.pptx
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.csv
*.ogg
*.mp4
*.winmd
*recovery_code*
*recovery-code*
